  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 0 - .",
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the buildings are occupied.",
    "Condition : 4 - The windows formed in the flank elevation shall be obscure glazed, hinged to open inwards and shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than with obscured glazing.",
    "Condition : 5 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in any wall of the extension hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of  8.00 am to  18.00 on Mondays to Friday and 8.00am  to  17.00 on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and public holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 8 - Before commencement of operations, a scheme shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority to cover the following matters:\r\n\r\n(i)\tany external illumination of the site\r\n\r\n(ii)\tmeasures to ensure that all mud and other loose materials are not carried on the wheels and chassis of any vehicles leaving the site; and\r\n\r\n(iii)\tmeasures to minimise dust nuisance caused by the operations and to ensure that no dust or other debris is carried on to the adjoining properties.\r\n\r\nThe scheme so approved should be fully implemented.\r\n",
    "Condition : 9 - The development shall not be occupied until screen planting along the eastern boundaries have been planted in accordance with a scheme submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority in writing.",
    "Condition : 10 - Prior to commencement of operations details of a method statement detailing the proposed strategy allowing construction vehicles access to and from the site should be submitted to, and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 11 - No occupancy of the proposed dwelling shall occur until further details of the approved access are submitted to, and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority, and until the access way is made operational. Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details, and vehicular access to the approved house thereafter retained from Heldman Close, as shown on drawing 27-29\\03/4 (Amended 5/2/04)."
  ],
